    <summary>Welcome to Hexo ! This is your very first post. Check documentation for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in troublesh…</summary>
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Welcome to <a href="https://hexo.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">Hexo</a>! This is your very first post. Check <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">documentation</a> for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/troubleshooting.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">troubleshooting</a> or you can ask me on <a href="https://github.com/hexojs/hexo/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">GitHub</a>.</p>
<h2 id="quick-start"><a class="heading-anchor" href="#quick-start" aria-hidden="true">#</a>Quick Start</h2>
<h3 id="create-a-new-post"><a class="heading-anchor" href="#create-a-new-post" aria-hidden="true">#</a>Create a new post</h3>
<figure class="code-block" data-lang="bash" data-lines="1"><pre><code class="hljs language-bash">$ hexo new <span class="hljs-string">&quot;My New Post&quot;</span></code></pre></figure>
<p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/writing.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">Writing</a></p>
<h3 id="run-server"><a class="heading-anchor" href="#run-server" aria-hidden="true">#</a>Run server</h3>
<figure class="code-block" data-lang="bash" data-lines="1"><pre><code class="hljs language-bash">$ hexo server</code></pre></figure>
<p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/server.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">Server</a></p>
<h3 id="generate-static-files"><a class="heading-anchor" href="#generate-static-files" aria-hidden="true">#</a>Generate static files</h3>
<figure class="code-block" data-lang="bash" data-lines="1"><pre><code class="hljs language-bash">$ hexo generate</code></pre></figure>
<p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/generating.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">Generating</a></p>
<h3 id="deploy-to-remote-sites"><a class="heading-anchor" href="#deploy-to-remote-sites" aria-hidden="true">#</a>Deploy to remote sites</h3>
<figure class="code-block" data-lang="bash" data-lines="1"><pre><code class="hljs language-bash">$ hexo deploy</code></pre></figure>
<p>More info: <a href="https://hexo.io/docs/one-command-deployment.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener external nofollow">Deployment</a></p>
]]></content>
